e your forever","columns":33,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":30,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"you were gonna be my wife","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":21,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"We didn't know any better","columns":25,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":20,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"lyric","text":"Didn't have a clue about life","columns":29,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":25,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"But I was what you wanted you were what I needed","columns":48,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":29,"beat":3}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"And we could meet in between","columns":28,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"F","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":22,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"We were gonna be the greatest love story this town had ever seen","columns":64,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D#","column":23,"beat":2},{"symbol":"F","column":48,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A#","column":62,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"instrumental","text":"(               )","columns":17,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":2,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":6,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":9,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A#","column":13,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"So you went off to college and I got a job I was working that 9 to 5","columns":71,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"A#","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"F","column":32,"beat":2},{"symbol":"D#","column":50,"beat":4},{"symbol":"A#","column":69,"beat":6}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"Dreaming of the days when you were in my arms I have never felt so alive","columns":72,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symb